Description: Fits Bayesian latent mixture models to trial-level fear
    generalization data. Models combine Rescorla-Wagner learning with
    similarity-based generalization to estimate learning rates, generalization
    gradients, response parameters, and uncertainty in latent group membership.
    Includes simulation, parameter recovery, convergence diagnostics, and
    posterior summaries. Based on Yu et al. (2023)
    <doi:10.1038/s44271-023-00005-0>.
